[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3422.87, "timestamp": "00:57:02", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3425.27, "timestamp": "00:57:05", "text": "しかし、なぜ少年が前にいるのか？   「"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3428.549, "timestamp": "00:57:08", "text": "すごい」と表示されるべきだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3431.03, "timestamp": "00:57:11", "text": "ええ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3432.95, "timestamp": "00:57:12", "text": "真ん中にあります。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3434.789, "timestamp": "00:57:14", "text": "うん、大丈夫だと思うよ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3436.95, "timestamp": "00:57:16", "text": "それは、いわばお釣りの"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3439.589, "timestamp": "00:57:19", "text": "時間のようなものですか？ ああ、あなたは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3442.069, "timestamp": "00:57:22", "text": "寝るんですよね？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3453.109, "timestamp": "00:57:33", "text": "。 基地へはどうやって行けばいいですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3454.71, "timestamp": "00:57:34", "text": "TPからできるのと同じように。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3457.75, "timestamp": "00:57:37", "text": "君はTP地点に行って、基地に戻ってくるんだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3460.15, "timestamp": "00:57:40", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3470.87, "timestamp": "00:57:50", "text": "フォックスはどこにいる？ ああ、フォックス・パーク。 それすら"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3473.67, "timestamp": "00:57:53", "text": "見つけられない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3475.829, "timestamp": "00:57:55", "text": "ああ、彼らは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3478.39, "timestamp": "00:57:58", "text": "スタート地点にいるよ。"}]